WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:10.927
-[water rippling]
-[Saeng-gang grunts]

2
00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.013
[panting]

3
00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:15.098
[uneasy music playing]

4
00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.104
[music intensifies]

5
00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:28.611
[Saeng-gang grunting]

6
00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.447
[grunts loudly]

7
00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:35.285
[panting]

8
00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.203
Gu-cheon.

9
00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:38.621
Gu-cheon!

10
00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.666
You need to wake up. Come back!

11
00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:43.334
Gu-cheon!

12
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.074
Support us and become VIP member 
to remove all ads from www.OpenSubtitles.org

13
00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:56.222
Are you all right?

14
00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.644
Gu-cheon! Gu-cheon!

15
00:01:04.939 --> 00:01:06.566
-[tense music playing]
-[gasps]

16
00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:09.360
[groaning]

17
00:01:09.444 --> 00:01:11.613
[Saeng-gang coughs. gasps]

18
00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.410
[Saeng-gang gasping]

19
00:01:20.705 --> 00:01:23.666
[spectral voice exclaiming]

20
00:01:25.168 --> 00:01:28.588
[Saeng-gang coughs. gasps]

21
00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:36.930
[Saeng-gang gasping]

22
00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:39.516
[grunts. gasping]

23
00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:45.730
[coughing]

24
00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:49.359
[music swells]

25
00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:54.364
THE EAST PALACE

26
00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:58.076
So you managed to deal with
the 13 court ladies' spirits

27
00:01:58.159 --> 00:01:59.953
in the salt storehouse.

28
00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:05.750
You did very well. You may leave now.

29
00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:07.710
There is something I must ask.

30
00:02:09.712 --> 00:02:13.341
Did you have anything to do with
the salt storehouse seal getting broken?

31
00:02:13.424 --> 00:02:15.051
You have changed.

32
00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:19.055
seeing that you now have the bravery
to ask such questions.

33
00:02:19.889 --> 00:02:22.517
However. you must've seen by now

34
00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.394
the bloodshed that words
other people have said

35
00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.020
can unleash within the palace.

36
00:02:26.104 --> 00:02:27.647
Or have you forgotten about your mother?

37
00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:29.816
"I'll dry out the seed
of the East Palace."

38
00:02:29.899 --> 00:02:32.360
Those were the words
of the Most Favored Lady of the Court.

39
00:02:32.443 --> 00:02:34.154
who drowned in the pond 30 years ago.

40
00:02:35.071 --> 00:02:36.698
She is the pond spirit. is she not?

41
00:02:36.781 --> 00:02:38.116
Who was that woman. actually?

42
00:02:38.199 --> 00:02:40.368
And what was the reason for her death?

43
00:02:40.451 --> 00:02:42.453
[mysterious pensive music playing]

44
00:02:43.872 --> 00:02:46.332
Are you the only one who knows of this.

45
00:02:47.041 --> 00:02:49.252
or does Gu-cheon know as well?

46
00:02:50.712 --> 00:02:52.547
I am the only one who knows.

47
00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.596
Do not say anything about it to him.

48
00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:01.848
Who was the pond spirit
when she was alive?

49
00:03:01.931 --> 00:03:04.100
I can catch her if you can answer me that.

50
00:03:05.643 --> 00:03:08.104
I am only telling you this one more time.

51
00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:10.899
Stop digging into the pond spirit.

52
00:03:10.982 --> 00:03:13.902
and find a way to catch it
without uncovering its identity.

53
00:03:13.985 --> 00:03:16.154
Cease this incessant prying immediately.

54
00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:20.200
Anyone who tries to uncover
the palace disgrace dies.

55
00:03:20.283 --> 00:03:21.326
Even if they are

56
00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:24.871
a child of the royal lineage.

57
00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:31.961
[Gu-cheon coughing]

58
00:03:32.921 --> 00:03:34.839
[Gu-cheon groans. coughs]

59
00:03:35.924 --> 00:03:37.342
[music fades]

60
00:03:38.176 --> 00:03:40.011
I assume you are not better?

61
00:03:41.262 --> 00:03:43.556
You're recovering much slower than before.

62
00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:47.268
Well. sending 13 spirits
back to the afterlife

63
00:03:47.352 --> 00:03:49.896
took most of my yang energy out of me.

64
00:03:51.231 --> 00:03:52.899
I will never do such an amount again.

65
00:03:52.982 --> 00:03:54.442
[coughs. sniffles]

66
00:03:54.525 --> 00:03:55.735
[Saeng-gang] All right.

67
00:03:55.818 --> 00:03:57.695
Can you explain what happened?

68
00:03:58.738 --> 00:04:00.698
Why did you strangle me back there?

69
00:04:01.282 --> 00:04:03.284
[uneasy music playing]

70
00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:07.830
[melancholy string music playing]

71
00:04:07.914 --> 00:04:10.208
-I strangled you?
-Yes.

72
00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:12.126
It was

73
00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:14.545
like you were almost possessed.

74
00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:16.798
[Gu-cheon sighs]

75
00:04:26.182 --> 00:04:27.684
Down in that world…

76
00:04:31.479 --> 00:04:34.524
I lose a large amount of my yang energy
when I fight.

77
00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:40.905
And when I lose too much yang energy.
I end up in a spirit-like state.

78
00:04:40.989 --> 00:04:43.157
even after coming out of the water.

79
00:04:45.201 --> 00:04:48.955
At times. I lose consciousness briefly.
and I'm unaware of anything at all.

80
00:04:52.041 --> 00:04:54.294
That is why I must leave here
as soon as I'm able to.

81
00:04:56.170 --> 00:05:00.133
And that is the reason
I hate hunting spirits.

82
00:05:08.766 --> 00:05:09.809
Right.

83
00:05:11.352 --> 00:05:12.770
[music fades]

84
00:05:12.854 --> 00:05:15.356
Now that I've revealed to you my secret.

85
00:05:16.566 --> 00:05:20.194
you should tell me…
what's really on your mind right now.

86
00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:23.948
Who is it that you want to kill
while you're here?

87
00:05:24.449 --> 00:05:26.117
[suspenseful music playing]

88
00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.119
The person who killed my mother.

89
00:05:28.202 --> 00:05:30.496
-[tense music playing]
-[women groaning in pain]

90
00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:35.418
A cursed object filled with human remains
was found in the salt storehouse.

91
00:05:36.294 --> 00:05:38.087
You gave His Majesty only one princess.

92
00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:40.381
and then. because of that.
you were never seen again.

93
00:05:40.465 --> 00:05:44.135
Out of jealousy. you cursed the Queen
and the rest of the concubines.

94
00:05:44.218 --> 00:05:45.303
did you not?

95
00:05:45.386 --> 00:05:46.763
I am innocent.

96
00:05:46.846 --> 00:05:48.181
[sobs. breathes shakily]

97
00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:51.309
That was not my cursed object.

98
00:05:51.392 --> 00:05:53.061
I swear it's not mine.

99
00:05:53.144 --> 00:05:54.103
[Queen] Enough.

100
00:05:55.104 --> 00:05:56.189
This is your doing.

101
00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:00.360
-[woman 1] Your Majesty.
-[Jang] Keep going.

102
00:06:00.443 --> 00:06:02.653
-[women crying]
-[woman 1] Your Majesty!

103
00:06:02.737 --> 00:06:04.530
[breathing heavily]

104
00:06:04.614 --> 00:06:05.948
[Saeng-gang] <i>Ten years ago.</i>

105
00:06:06.532 --> 00:06:08.910
<i>it was Her Majesty the Queen Dowager</i>
<i>who framed my mother</i>

106
00:06:08.993 --> 00:06:10.578
<i>and forced her out of the palace.</i>

107
00:06:11.162 --> 00:06:12.997
It is Mother. Please help her.

108
00:06:13.081 --> 00:06:15.792
Mother and the court maids are innocent.

109
00:06:15.875 --> 00:06:19.212
Oh. please. Father.
The Queen is hurting Mother.

110
00:06:19.295 --> 00:06:22.382
I know that it is all my fault because
I heard a strange voice. but I promise--

111
00:06:22.465 --> 00:06:24.133
-Enough.
-[gasps]

112
00:06:24.217 --> 00:06:26.844
She will be stripped of her station
for burying a cursed object

113
00:06:26.928 --> 00:06:28.262
and then banished.

114
00:06:28.888 --> 00:06:30.390
That is the only way she will live.

115
00:06:30.473 --> 00:06:33.518
But that cursed object was not Mother's.
It was not. Father.

116
00:06:34.185 --> 00:06:37.730
The spirit in the salt storehouse said.
"The serpent's shed skin--"

117
00:06:37.814 --> 00:06:39.857
-[young Saeng-gang gasps]
-[mysterious music playing]

118
00:06:39.941 --> 00:06:41.692
It's best you hold your tongue.

119
00:06:42.568 --> 00:06:45.196
You must not tell me
that you hear such things.

120
00:06:45.279 --> 00:06:47.490
Not any child that bears my blood.

121
00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:50.243
Unless you wish to bring disgrace
to our name.

122
00:06:51.452 --> 00:06:54.956
Do not tell a single soul any of it.

123
00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.333
Do you understand?

124
00:07:01.546 --> 00:07:03.423
How foolish you are.

125
00:07:05.466 --> 00:07:06.926
How utterly foolish.

126
00:07:07.009 --> 00:07:09.137
You need to learn your place.

127
00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:13.141
Now. mind your tongue in the palace.

128
00:07:18.938 --> 00:07:20.940
[breathing shakily]

129
00:07:31.659 --> 00:07:34.912
You and your mother
shall be cast out at once!

130
00:07:38.207 --> 00:07:39.959
But. Father. please…

131
00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.627
How could you?

132
00:07:44.505 --> 00:07:46.507
[melancholy music playing]

133
00:07:54.348 --> 00:07:56.559
[Saeng-gang]
<i>After we were cast out of the palace.</i>

134
00:07:57.685 --> 00:07:59.812
<i>Mother was poisoned to death.</i>

135
00:08:01.522 --> 00:08:05.109
<i>All because she uncovered</i>
<i>the cursed object in the salt storehouse</i>

136
00:08:05.193 --> 00:08:07.820
<i>and drew close</i>
<i>to the secret of the pond spirit.</i>

137
00:08:08.321 --> 00:08:10.573
The one who sought to protect
the pond spirit's secret

138
00:08:10.656 --> 00:08:12.700
is the one who killed my innocent mother.

139
00:08:15.578 --> 00:08:17.121
Are you sure you should be saying this?

140
00:08:17.205 --> 00:08:20.541
I need you to be able to unravel
my mother's secret.

141
00:08:21.042 --> 00:08:23.127
That's why I place my trust in you.

142
00:08:23.211 --> 00:08:24.587
[Gu-cheon] Good heavens.

143
00:08:25.254 --> 00:08:27.256
What a life this is. [grunts]

144
00:08:28.591 --> 00:08:29.759
[Gu-cheon moans]

145
00:08:31.385 --> 00:08:32.678
[Gu-cheon] You can leave now.

146
00:08:35.723 --> 00:08:36.724
[sighs]

147
00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:42.563
We need to find the true identity
of the Most Favored Lady of the Court.

148
00:08:42.647 --> 00:08:43.981
Get ready and come out.

149
00:08:46.025 --> 00:08:47.485
[door opens]

150
00:08:48.319 --> 00:08:51.072
[music fades]

151
00:08:51.155 --> 00:08:54.534
I went to pay my respects
at the Queen Dowager's quarters

152
00:08:54.617 --> 00:08:56.285
and saw Saeng-gang walking by.

153
00:08:57.662 --> 00:09:01.082
She was dressed as a court lady
and accompanied by a man.

154
00:09:01.165 --> 00:09:03.751
Have you made her do something dangerous?

155
00:09:03.834 --> 00:09:06.170
You need not concern yourself with it.

156
00:09:07.547 --> 00:09:08.714
Mother.

157
00:09:10.007 --> 00:09:11.008
do you not remember?

158
00:09:11.092 --> 00:09:13.052
You need only attend to my son.

159
00:09:15.888 --> 00:09:17.098
That aside…

160
00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:22.728
the Queen Dowager
is harboring some ulterior motives.

161
00:09:22.812 --> 00:09:24.814
[unsettling music playing]

162
00:09:27.233 --> 00:09:29.318
It seems she intends…

163
00:09:31.112 --> 00:09:34.282
to have Prince Iksang's eldest son named
Crown Prince.

164
00:09:35.992 --> 00:09:37.368
Well. even so.

165
00:09:38.119 --> 00:09:41.872
we must act for the sake of
the Jongmyo Shrine and good fortune altar.

166
00:09:41.956 --> 00:09:44.542
[scoffs. laughs]

167
00:10:00.558 --> 00:10:04.353
Are you saying that even though you know
what I had to endure for this seat.

168
00:10:04.437 --> 00:10:07.732
you still choose to come and tell me
to act for the sake of the shrine?

169
00:10:09.108 --> 00:10:12.445
Things will not unfold
as the Queen Dowager intends them to be.

170
00:10:12.528 --> 00:10:16.907
My son will take the throne.
and I will make sure that it does happen.

171
00:10:16.991 --> 00:10:18.701
It will be his.

172
00:10:21.162 --> 00:10:22.496
Yes.

173
00:10:24.498 --> 00:10:27.585
Even if I do have to conjure spirits.

174
00:10:32.006 --> 00:10:33.049
There.

175
00:10:33.132 --> 00:10:34.258
[music fades]

176
00:10:34.342 --> 00:10:35.426
[window opens]

177
00:10:36.302 --> 00:10:37.928
Why did we sneak
into Lady Jang's quarters?

178
00:10:38.012 --> 00:10:39.764
It's not as if we are thieves.

179
00:10:40.264 --> 00:10:41.140
[sighs]

180
00:10:41.849 --> 00:10:43.726
Are you the sage of morality? Huh?

181
00:10:45.061 --> 00:10:48.147
Lady Jang has spent her entire life
by the Queen Dowager's side.

182
00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:50.399
She must know all of her secrets.

183
00:10:50.483 --> 00:10:53.903
So I'm trying to scare her into spilling
everything about the pond spirit.

184
00:10:54.904 --> 00:10:56.864
Then do it correctly. all right?

185
00:10:56.947 --> 00:10:58.074
And what is that?

186
00:10:58.157 --> 00:10:59.200
[sighs]

187
00:10:59.283 --> 00:11:00.117
[woman 1] Madam.

188
00:11:00.743 --> 00:11:03.204
-You're back earlier than usual.
-[Gu-cheon grunts]

189
00:11:03.287 --> 00:11:05.998
[Jang] I was not feeling myself.
I came back to rest.

190
00:11:09.627 --> 00:11:11.087
[Gu-cheon] Wait! Uh…

191
00:11:12.505 --> 00:11:13.422
[gasps]

192
00:11:14.548 --> 00:11:15.800
-[door rattling]
-[Jang grunts]

193
00:11:16.384 --> 00:11:18.135
Who… Who are you?

194
00:11:18.636 --> 00:11:20.388
Who gave you permission to come in here?

195
00:11:22.973 --> 00:11:24.767
The pond spirit is…

196
00:11:27.269 --> 00:11:28.354
is right here. with you.

197
00:11:28.437 --> 00:11:30.940
Wait. are you not that feng shui man
who recently got here?

198
00:11:31.023 --> 00:11:33.109
-What are you doing in my quarters?
-Sh. Sh.

199
00:11:34.694 --> 00:11:36.904
-Look at these footprints on the floor.
-[Jang gasps]

200
00:11:38.072 --> 00:11:39.031
[Jang] What…

201
00:11:39.615 --> 00:11:40.700
This is not pond mud.

202
00:11:40.783 --> 00:11:42.993
[Jang] Get out of here immediately.
or I'll call someone.

203
00:11:43.077 --> 00:11:44.161
-[Gu-cheon] Hold on!
-I will!

204
00:11:44.245 --> 00:11:46.080
I can feel the pond spirit.
It's close to us.

205
00:11:46.163 --> 00:11:47.957
-[Jang] What?
-[Gu-cheon breathes shakily]

206
00:11:48.582 --> 00:11:51.001
-[purrs]
-[Gu-cheon] The pond spirit is over there.

207
00:11:51.919 --> 00:11:53.379
[Jang] What… What is…

208
00:11:53.462 --> 00:11:55.548
[Gu-cheon] Hey you!
You should earn your keep.

209
00:11:55.631 --> 00:11:57.591
-[Jang] This bastard…
-Do what you do best. Now!

210
00:11:57.675 --> 00:12:00.344
-[Jang] What do you think you are doing?
-Hey! Come on.

211
00:12:00.428 --> 00:12:02.596
[Jang] What are you doing?
Explain yourself.

212
00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:05.015
-[Gu-cheon] Hey.
-How dare you pull such an absurd stunt!

213
00:12:05.099 --> 00:12:06.809
Somebody come in here now!

214
00:12:06.892 --> 00:12:08.894
-[Saeng-gang crying]
-[door rattling]

215
00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.108
[Jang] Where is that crying coming from?

216
00:12:14.191 --> 00:12:17.027
I will dry out the seed
of the East Palace.

217
00:12:17.111 --> 00:12:18.028
[sobs]

218
00:12:20.364 --> 00:12:23.492
[Gu-cheon] It's the pond spirit.
The pond spirit has come.

219
00:12:23.576 --> 00:12:26.454
Did I not tell you when I went
to the Queen Dowager's quarters?

220
00:12:26.537 --> 00:12:29.498
A won-gwi seeks out the one
responsible for its death.

221
00:12:29.582 --> 00:12:31.584
[purring]

222
00:12:32.251 --> 00:12:34.253
[ominous music playing]

223
00:12:34.962 --> 00:12:36.964
[Jang whimpering. gasping]

224
00:12:45.139 --> 00:12:46.307
[whimpers]

225
00:12:48.517 --> 00:12:50.186
[music swells]

226
00:12:50.269 --> 00:12:51.562
[spectral scream]

227
00:12:51.645 --> 00:12:53.689
[Jang screaming]

228
00:12:54.523 --> 00:12:55.775
[Jang gasps]

229
00:12:55.858 --> 00:12:58.319
[air whooshing]

230
00:12:58.861 --> 00:13:00.112
[belches]

231
00:13:00.196 --> 00:13:01.363
[purrs]

232
00:13:05.743 --> 00:13:09.079
[Gu-cheon] Homage to Amitabha Buddha.
Homage to Amitabha Buddha.

233
00:13:11.916 --> 00:13:13.667
Homage to Amitabha Buddha.

234
00:13:14.168 --> 00:13:16.086
You said you were a feng shui master?

235
00:13:18.297 --> 00:13:20.925
Do you also know how to deal with spirits?

236
00:13:22.551 --> 00:13:23.594
[Gu-cheon clears throat]

237
00:13:24.887 --> 00:13:26.472
Speaking of which…

238
00:13:28.808 --> 00:13:30.726
The thing is. Lady Jang.

239
00:13:32.144 --> 00:13:35.189
this spirit will come looking for you
again any moment.

240
00:13:35.272 --> 00:13:36.857
It will? [breathes shakily]

241
00:13:39.401 --> 00:13:41.195
What should I do if it does?

242
00:13:41.278 --> 00:13:44.073
[Gu-cheon] In order to keep
the pond spirit from coming in here.

243
00:13:44.156 --> 00:13:48.828
I have to know exactly how it lived
when it was alive.

244
00:13:49.537 --> 00:13:50.621
[Jang breathes nervously]

245
00:13:50.704 --> 00:13:53.958
[Saeng-gang] Do not worry. Lady Jang.
You can tell him everything you know.

246
00:13:54.834 --> 00:13:57.086
He will keep it a secret
from the Queen Dowager.

247
00:13:57.169 --> 00:13:58.629
He's capable of doing that.

248
00:13:58.712 --> 00:13:59.630
[Gu-cheon] What?

249
00:14:02.258 --> 00:14:03.384
Of course.

250
00:14:04.677 --> 00:14:05.803
So. then.

251
00:14:07.346 --> 00:14:09.181
who might that ghost be?

252
00:14:09.265 --> 00:14:10.432
[sighs nervously]

253
00:14:11.392 --> 00:14:13.018
The spirit is…

254
00:14:18.983 --> 00:14:20.776
the late King's

255
00:14:21.735 --> 00:14:24.071
last Most Favored Court Lady.

256
00:14:24.154 --> 00:14:26.156
[tense music playing]

257
00:14:28.826 --> 00:14:33.163
[Jang] <i>A woman of the lowest birth.</i>
<i>nothing more than a menial labor maid.</i>

258
00:14:33.247 --> 00:14:35.332
<i>caught the late King's eye</i>

259
00:14:36.208 --> 00:14:38.002
<i>and received his favor</i>

260
00:14:38.085 --> 00:14:40.045
<i>and even conceived his child.</i>

261
00:14:40.671 --> 00:14:42.673
[men grunting]

262
00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:46.260
[Jang] <i>But it later came to light</i>
<i>that the woman</i>

263
00:14:47.219 --> 00:14:50.848
<i>was in a relationship with a royal guard.</i>

264
00:14:54.184 --> 00:14:56.896
<i>When Her Majesty found out</i>
<i>about that fact…</i>

265
00:14:56.979 --> 00:14:58.689
-[water splashing]
-[grunting]

266
00:14:58.772 --> 00:15:00.608
<i>…she ordered the royal guard</i>
<i>to be tortured.</i>

267
00:15:00.691 --> 00:15:01.775
[soldier] Hold still!

268
00:15:01.859 --> 00:15:02.943
[gasping]

269
00:15:03.027 --> 00:15:06.113
-[Jang] <i>But he did not readily confess.</i>
-[coughs. groans]

270
00:15:07.197 --> 00:15:10.492
[Jang] <i>So soldiers were sent out.</i>
<i>and they uncovered evidence.</i>

271
00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.288
<i>-And in the end. he admitted to the crime.</i>
-Search it!

272
00:15:14.788 --> 00:15:16.874
It turned out that the child

273
00:15:18.459 --> 00:15:20.586
was not the late King's at all.

274
00:15:20.669 --> 00:15:22.838
It was the royal guard's.

275
00:15:22.922 --> 00:15:25.174
After enduring torture.

276
00:15:25.674 --> 00:15:27.509
the Most Favored Lady miscarried

277
00:15:27.593 --> 00:15:31.388
and died with resentment
for the royal family burning in her heart.

278
00:15:31.472 --> 00:15:34.850
I will dry out the seed
of the East Palace! [screams]

279
00:15:34.934 --> 00:15:36.936
-[blade slices]
-[women screaming]

280
00:15:37.019 --> 00:15:39.021
[women gasping]

281
00:15:39.647 --> 00:15:41.398
[Gu-cheon] <i>Then what happened to her body?</i>

282
00:15:42.316 --> 00:15:43.442
Do you know?

283
00:15:45.694 --> 00:15:48.364
It was secretly taken out of the palace.

284
00:15:48.447 --> 00:15:50.908
A grave would never have been an option.

285
00:15:51.575 --> 00:15:52.910
And her belongings?

286
00:15:53.744 --> 00:15:56.246
As a traitor to the Crown.
the body was burned.

287
00:15:57.831 --> 00:16:00.709
So there is nothing left of her
besides her memory?

288
00:16:04.213 --> 00:16:07.424
She had no family.
so it was to be expected.

289
00:16:09.426 --> 00:16:10.761
-[music fades]
-[Jang moans]

290
00:16:10.844 --> 00:16:13.222
So the Most Favored Lady of the Court
cursed the royal house

291
00:16:13.305 --> 00:16:15.224
after dying for her own wrongdoing?

292
00:16:16.934 --> 00:16:18.686
Surely that isn't everything.

293
00:16:18.769 --> 00:16:21.313
A hidden palace disgrace lies behind this.

294
00:16:24.108 --> 00:16:26.193
I will have to ask it myself. then.

295
00:16:26.694 --> 00:16:28.696
Is there a way to summon the spirit?

296
00:16:29.488 --> 00:16:31.073
Then what will you do?

297
00:16:31.156 --> 00:16:33.367
There's no way to send it
to the afterlife.

298
00:16:39.206 --> 00:16:40.708
Lady Jang mentioned

299
00:16:41.208 --> 00:16:43.168
that everybody who entered
the royal guard's house

300
00:16:43.252 --> 00:16:44.712
seemed to have met an untimely death.

301
00:16:44.795 --> 00:16:47.172
It appears the royal guard's spirit
has settled himself there.

302
00:16:47.256 --> 00:16:48.215
Exactly.

303
00:16:48.298 --> 00:16:50.759
There's a reason the royal guard died
and remained in that house

304
00:16:50.843 --> 00:16:52.386
instead of moving on.

305
00:16:52.469 --> 00:16:55.806
Since they were lovers.
her belongings may still be there.

306
00:16:57.307 --> 00:16:58.976
We must stop by his house immediately.

307
00:16:59.059 --> 00:17:00.519
Have you lost your mind?

308
00:17:01.395 --> 00:17:02.813
An untimely death is your big plan?

309
00:17:02.896 --> 00:17:04.523
Have you made a plan?

310
00:17:05.441 --> 00:17:08.110
I'm the one who can leave
and come back as I please.

311
00:17:08.193 --> 00:17:09.862
I know of another way I can leave.

312
00:17:10.446 --> 00:17:12.114
If I become a soul.

313
00:17:14.241 --> 00:17:16.118
[mysterious pensive music playing]

314
00:17:16.201 --> 00:17:18.829
Is that even… possible?

315
00:17:19.788 --> 00:17:21.790
It is. but also dangerous.

316
00:17:22.374 --> 00:17:25.044
If the body and soul drift too far apart…

317
00:17:27.171 --> 00:17:29.048
it will be difficult to return.

318
00:17:30.257 --> 00:17:31.508
If I fail.

319
00:17:32.676 --> 00:17:34.511
my soul could lose its way…

320
00:17:36.889 --> 00:17:38.682
and I will become a spirit.

321
00:17:41.226 --> 00:17:43.896
If that happens.
I will surely become an ak-gwi.

322
00:17:43.979 --> 00:17:45.814
And what is that?

323
00:17:46.774 --> 00:17:50.319
An ak-gwi is someone who died
but is burdened with great karma.

324
00:17:51.403 --> 00:17:52.654
In life. you…

325
00:17:54.823 --> 00:17:56.075
[music subsides]

326
00:17:56.742 --> 00:17:57.868
Are you all right?

327
00:17:57.951 --> 00:17:59.661
[unsettling music playing]

328
00:18:02.664 --> 00:18:05.167
[melodic spectral voice singing]

329
00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:07.628
[Saeng-gang] Do you see something
in that well over there?

330
00:18:13.008 --> 00:18:15.010
[mystical ethereal music playing]

331
00:18:15.844 --> 00:18:17.513
You do not look very well.

332
00:18:18.305 --> 00:18:20.140
If you need my yang energy. I could--

333
00:18:20.224 --> 00:18:21.850
If you wanted to give me your yang energy.

334
00:18:21.934 --> 00:18:24.603
then you would have to hold me close
and lend me your warmth.

335
00:18:24.686 --> 00:18:25.896
Can you do that?

336
00:18:28.732 --> 00:18:29.858
Forget it.

337
00:18:29.942 --> 00:18:32.111
I have no intention of doing that either.

338
00:18:32.945 --> 00:18:34.613
So are you going to stay like this?

339
00:18:34.696 --> 00:18:36.740
No. It will only get worse.

340
00:18:36.824 --> 00:18:38.826
Then from now on. I will go with you

341
00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:41.787
to that realm to help you.

342
00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:43.580
Two are better than one.

343
00:18:43.664 --> 00:18:45.207
Teach me how to go there.

344
00:18:47.251 --> 00:18:48.919
Let's be perfectly clear.

345
00:18:49.419 --> 00:18:52.256
You would like me to show you
how to die like me?

346
00:18:52.756 --> 00:18:55.092
I should be spending my days helping you.

347
00:18:55.175 --> 00:18:56.927
There is only one way you could.

348
00:18:58.011 --> 00:18:59.930
Go and tell the King what you know.

349
00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:03.600
Tell him we can't capture
the pond spirit any longer

350
00:19:04.268 --> 00:19:07.271
and that I may lose my mind
and start killing people.

351
00:19:07.354 --> 00:19:08.522
so he must let me go.

352
00:19:14.194 --> 00:19:15.779
That is not possible.

353
00:19:16.905 --> 00:19:18.198
You have to find a way.

354
00:19:18.282 --> 00:19:22.661
And do not naively believe
that he will let you leave the palace.

355
00:19:26.957 --> 00:19:29.751
Then I must choose
to leave here in death after all.

356
00:19:31.962 --> 00:19:33.338
[tense music stinger]

357
00:19:35.257 --> 00:19:37.384
If I die within these walls.

358
00:19:38.427 --> 00:19:40.888
I will return
as an intensely ruthless ak-gwi.

359
00:19:40.971 --> 00:19:42.639
And when I do come back…

360
00:19:44.892 --> 00:19:47.227
the first person I will kill is the King.

361
00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:50.856
I'm sorry.

362
00:19:52.191 --> 00:19:54.735
Are you daring
to threaten His Majesty's life?

363
00:19:54.818 --> 00:19:56.153
Why does it matter to you?

364
00:19:57.196 --> 00:19:58.864
You hate him as much as I do.

365
00:19:58.947 --> 00:20:01.783
Yes. however. he is this country's King.

366
00:20:01.867 --> 00:20:04.536
Those of royal blood are all the same.

367
00:20:05.829 --> 00:20:08.415
They use whoever they please
to get what they want.

368
00:20:08.916 --> 00:20:11.919
and they don't blink
over the death or life of others.

369
00:20:13.879 --> 00:20:15.964
You're just the same as the rest.

370
00:20:21.678 --> 00:20:22.721
[woman] Miss?

371
00:20:26.642 --> 00:20:27.935
[music fades]

372
00:20:28.018 --> 00:20:31.188
Royal Noble Consort Sukbin
wishes to see you.

373
00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:35.234
[Saeng-gang]
It has been a while. Grandmother.

374
00:20:35.317 --> 00:20:37.110
His Majesty told me everything.

375
00:20:37.611 --> 00:20:41.490
How could you think to disguise yourself
as a court lady and enter the gates?

376
00:20:41.573 --> 00:20:44.159
And why are you back
in these walls again. Grandmother?

377
00:20:44.243 --> 00:20:47.204
It was you who hated coming in here
more than anybody.

378
00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:49.998
You will not be answering my question.
will you?

379
00:20:50.082 --> 00:20:52.167
Predisposed to change the subject.

380
00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.336
[sighs]

381
00:20:54.419 --> 00:20:56.088
I am exhausted. [chuckles]

382
00:20:56.171 --> 00:20:58.966
-[Sukbin] Oh.
-Goodness gracious.

383
00:21:00.884 --> 00:21:01.927
[Saeng-gang sighs]

384
00:21:03.136 --> 00:21:04.221
Saeng-gang.

385
00:21:06.181 --> 00:21:08.976
I hope you do not get swept up
in palace strife again.

386
00:21:09.059 --> 00:21:11.311
like you did when you were a child.

387
00:21:11.395 --> 00:21:12.396
[Saeng-gang chuckles]

388
00:21:13.981 --> 00:21:15.565
In the end. Grandmother.

389
00:21:17.025 --> 00:21:18.735
only you worry about me.

390
00:21:21.989 --> 00:21:24.741
After Mother and I
were driven out of here forever.

391
00:21:25.284 --> 00:21:27.536
you were the only person
who took care of us.

392
00:21:28.078 --> 00:21:29.621
no matter what went on.

393
00:21:30.956 --> 00:21:32.499
And how is that man?

394
00:21:32.582 --> 00:21:35.377
I have heard that he is strange
and rather dangerous.

395
00:21:37.671 --> 00:21:39.631
He is strange. I must admit.

396
00:21:40.215 --> 00:21:42.676
But he is the one
I need most in this moment.

397
00:21:44.094 --> 00:21:45.929
He can be dangerous as well.

398
00:21:48.015 --> 00:21:51.310
But I do not care. as long as
I do not begin seeking his friendship.

399
00:21:53.645 --> 00:21:56.857
The palace is a place
where the healthy become ill.

400
00:21:56.940 --> 00:21:58.191
[unsettling music playing]

401
00:21:58.275 --> 00:22:01.820
And people with darkness in their hearts
will end as ak-gwi.

402
00:22:03.905 --> 00:22:05.699
So you see. you must take care.

403
00:22:12.414 --> 00:22:13.707
[voice echoes] <i>Gu-cheon.</i>

404
00:22:17.169 --> 00:22:18.337
<i>Gu-cheon?</i>

405
00:22:20.922 --> 00:22:22.507
<i>My baby.</i>

406
00:22:24.217 --> 00:22:26.053
<i>Let me hold you just once.</i>

407
00:22:28.388 --> 00:22:31.016
<i>You have missed me. have you not?</i>

408
00:22:33.852 --> 00:22:35.687
<i>Come here.</i>

409
00:22:38.815 --> 00:22:41.443
[tense sinister music plays]

410
00:22:42.903 --> 00:22:44.404
[music fades]

411
00:22:54.247 --> 00:22:57.125
[woman 1] This is an ill omen.
People have died here before.

412
00:22:57.209 --> 00:22:58.710
That is why the well was sealed.

413
00:22:58.794 --> 00:23:01.171
And now
another menial labor maid has died.

414
00:23:01.254 --> 00:23:04.549
A menial labor maid carrying wash water
walked by the well at dawn

415
00:23:04.633 --> 00:23:06.176
and saw a man was by it.

416
00:23:06.259 --> 00:23:07.969
-[woman 1] Is that so?
-[woman 2] Yes.

417
00:23:08.053 --> 00:23:11.556
The maid said it was the feng shui master
staying at the East Palace.

418
00:23:12.057 --> 00:23:14.601
Shall I turn him over
to the State Tribunal for questioning?

419
00:23:14.684 --> 00:23:17.687
[woman 1] No. The Queen Dowager's
70th birthday banquet is drawing near.

420
00:23:17.771 --> 00:23:19.314
This must be handled discreetly.

421
00:23:19.981 --> 00:23:21.733
We must not make a fuss.

422
00:23:21.817 --> 00:23:23.110
[women] Yes. madam.

423
00:23:23.193 --> 00:23:25.195
[mysterious music playing]

424
00:23:27.989 --> 00:23:31.576
[indistinct chattering]

425
00:23:33.703 --> 00:23:35.705
[ominous music plays]

426
00:23:37.499 --> 00:23:39.501
[unsettling music playing]

427
00:23:53.557 --> 00:23:54.683
[Saeng-gang] Gu-cheon.

428
00:23:54.766 --> 00:23:56.476
[panting]

429
00:24:01.022 --> 00:24:02.190
[gasps]

430
00:24:03.108 --> 00:24:04.734
Explain this bloodstain.

431
00:24:06.987 --> 00:24:09.739
[breathing shakily] What is this?

432
00:24:10.782 --> 00:24:13.243
Explain to me why you were
wandering around at midnight.

433
00:24:13.952 --> 00:24:15.495
Whose blood is this?

434
00:24:16.788 --> 00:24:18.206
What do you mean "whose"?

435
00:24:20.834 --> 00:24:22.502
Are you telling me
that I have hurt someone?

436
00:24:26.256 --> 00:24:27.841
Then it must be your blood.

437
00:24:29.301 --> 00:24:31.761
Where were you hurt? Why were you hurt?

438
00:24:31.845 --> 00:24:34.306
My nose must have bled
after I had nodded off.

439
00:24:36.141 --> 00:24:37.809
After fighting the court ladies.

440
00:24:38.685 --> 00:24:40.145
I lost my strength.

441
00:24:40.770 --> 00:24:43.607
And that Ggeomeoksali
is still draining my yang energy.

442
00:24:47.027 --> 00:24:48.487
I have already told you

443
00:24:48.570 --> 00:24:51.531
that I lose my yang energy
in the other world.

444
00:24:57.746 --> 00:24:58.914
[Saeng-gang sighs]

445
00:25:10.926 --> 00:25:12.928
[door opens. closes]

446
00:25:13.011 --> 00:25:15.347
[breathing shakily]

447
00:25:15.430 --> 00:25:17.849
-[groaning]
-[tense music playing]

448
00:25:20.310 --> 00:25:21.603
[woman] Prince Yeongan.

449
00:25:24.064 --> 00:25:26.066
You must regain your strength.
Prince Yeongan.

450
00:25:26.149 --> 00:25:29.945
It was not this severe before.
Your Majesty.

451
00:25:30.028 --> 00:25:32.197
but his condition suddenly worsened.

452
00:25:39.204 --> 00:25:41.206
[tense music continues]

453
00:26:05.313 --> 00:26:06.648
[King] Coming here.

454
00:26:07.566 --> 00:26:11.861
it brings me back to the days when
I lived in the East Palace as a young boy.

455
00:26:12.862 --> 00:26:15.907
This place still sends chills
down my spine.

456
00:26:16.908 --> 00:26:19.703
[Gu-cheon] So what brings you
to such a dreadful place?

457
00:26:21.454 --> 00:26:22.330
[tense music playing]

458
00:26:22.414 --> 00:26:24.708
How much longer do I have to wait?

459
00:26:25.709 --> 00:26:27.877
I came in person to hear your answer.

460
00:26:27.961 --> 00:26:30.213
[Gu-cheon] First of all.
allow me to leave the palace.

461
00:26:30.297 --> 00:26:31.673
If I stay here any longer.

462
00:26:32.340 --> 00:26:34.801
then all of the palace's yin energy
will kill me.

463
00:26:36.052 --> 00:26:37.637
If you let me leave here.

464
00:26:37.721 --> 00:26:40.348
I will find a way
to capture the pond spirit.

465
00:26:43.935 --> 00:26:47.522
Tomorrow is the Queen Dowager's
70th birthday banquet.

466
00:26:48.523 --> 00:26:51.693
Eliminate the pond spirit
and restore Prince Yeongan.

467
00:26:52.444 --> 00:26:53.820
You will have until noon.

468
00:26:54.863 --> 00:26:56.323
Your Majesty. I just--

469
00:26:56.406 --> 00:26:58.325
Your life means nothing to me.

470
00:26:59.326 --> 00:27:03.246
The day you will leave here
is the day that I no longer draw breath.

471
00:27:03.997 --> 00:27:08.168
If my son cannot walk directly
into the Queen's banquet

472
00:27:08.251 --> 00:27:10.837
on his own two feet tomorrow.
I promise I will kill you

473
00:27:10.920 --> 00:27:13.006
and bind your soul to this palace
for all time.

474
00:27:13.089 --> 00:27:14.966
Do you understand?

475
00:27:15.717 --> 00:27:17.260
Do you understand?

476
00:27:30.732 --> 00:27:32.734
[music intensifies]

477
00:27:41.660 --> 00:27:43.286
[music fades]

478
00:27:46.665 --> 00:27:50.335
Wait. Are you not the feng shui man
who has been staying in the East Palace?

479
00:27:50.418 --> 00:27:52.879
Why are you in a place
reserved only for women?

480
00:27:54.255 --> 00:27:56.299
-Where is the owner of these quarters?
-Pardon?

481
00:27:56.383 --> 00:27:58.885
I may be younger than you.
but I am still a court lady.

482
00:27:58.968 --> 00:28:00.136
Watch how you speak to me.

483
00:28:00.220 --> 00:28:02.430
This will not do. You should be helping.

484
00:28:02.514 --> 00:28:04.599
Wait. what? I… I mean… What?

485
00:28:05.684 --> 00:28:07.894
The order came from Miss Saeng-gang.
Hurry.

486
00:28:08.395 --> 00:28:09.646
Uh. oh…

487
00:28:11.106 --> 00:28:13.108
[unsettling music playing]

488
00:28:19.864 --> 00:28:21.324
[Ji-yul] What is he doing?

489
00:28:23.201 --> 00:28:24.035
[blows air]

490
00:28:25.203 --> 00:28:27.455
[Ji-yul gasps] Wait. What are you doing?

491
00:28:27.539 --> 00:28:29.541
[dramatic percussive music playing]

492
00:28:42.512 --> 00:28:45.557
[Ji-yul] What exactly
did Miss Saeng-gang order you to do?

493
00:28:45.640 --> 00:28:46.933
[Gu-cheon] <i>Place this brass basin</i>

494
00:28:47.016 --> 00:28:49.769
<i>near the residence</i>
<i>of the royal guard's house in Jungchon.</i>

495
00:28:50.729 --> 00:28:52.105
<i>Mark my words.</i>

496
00:28:52.731 --> 00:28:54.899
<i>You must not spill this water.</i>

497
00:28:57.402 --> 00:28:59.154
<i>I have no choice</i>

498
00:29:00.238 --> 00:29:03.658
<i>but to become a soul and seek out</i>
<i>the royal guard through my blood.</i>

499
00:29:06.119 --> 00:29:06.995
[grunts]

500
00:29:15.837 --> 00:29:17.464
[thunder rumbling]

501
00:29:17.547 --> 00:29:18.882
[panicked screams]

502
00:29:19.841 --> 00:29:21.217
What is going on?

503
00:29:21.301 --> 00:29:25.054
It looks like some lightning
struck the jujube tree just now.

504
00:29:25.138 --> 00:29:26.723
